graph LR
    AP["llm-d-async<br/>Async Processor"]

    %% Internal Platform Dependencies
    AP -->|dispatch requests| Router["llm-d-router<br/>(inference gateway)"]
    AP -->|shared flow-control<br/>metric definitions| GAIE["gateway-api-inference-<br/>extension v1.2.1"]
    AP -->|capacity queries| Prom["Prometheus"]

    %% External Dependencies - Runtime
    AP -->|metrics server,<br/>signal handling| CtrlRuntime["controller-runtime<br/>v0.22.5"]
    AP -->|K8s API client| ClientGo["client-go<br/>v0.34.12"]
    AP -->|message queue| GoRedis["go-redis<br/>v9.22.0"]
    AP -->|alt transport| GCPPubSub["cloud.google.com<br/>pubsub v2.7.0"]
    AP -->|backlog metrics| GCPMon["cloud.google.com<br/>monitoring v1.31.0"]
    AP -->|metrics exposition| PromClient["prometheus<br/>client_golang v1.24.1"]
    AP -->|metric queries| PromCommon["prometheus<br/>common v0.72.0"]
    AP -->|distributed tracing| OTel["opentelemetry<br/>v1.47.0"]
    AP -->|HTTP tracing| OTelHTTP["otelhttp<br/>v0.72.0"]
    AP -->|structured logging| Zap["zap v1.28.0"]
    AP -->|gRPC transport| GRPC["grpc v1.84.0"]

    %% Integration Points (inbound)
    PromOp["Prometheus Operator"] -->|PodMonitor scrape| AP
    PromOp -->|PrometheusRule alerts| AP

